  "title": "Mini Frittatas with Quinoa",
  "description": "Savory bites of quinoa, eggs, zucchini, cheese, and ham are equally excellent hot or cold. Ideal for breakfast, brunch, lunch, or dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Laka kuharica - Easy Cook"
